# Visual source of truth

Destination mocks (Claude Calendar / Feeds HTML, later per-screen mocks) lock
**size, weight, spacing, and color**. Put those values in
`design-tokens/tokens.json` (new or updated roles) in the same PR and consume
generated tokens. Do **not** snap to a nearby existing role (34px → `hero` 26,
26px gap → `space-xl` 24, 14/500 → `body` 15/400).

**Exception:** WCAG AA (4.5:1 text, 3.0:1 icons) may adjust a mock hex. That
does not authorize ignoring mock type or spacing.

If a mock conflicts with an older lock, ask; expected answer is defer to the
mock. Details: `docs/ui-system.md`.
